  "operative_text": "Section 1 (SDCL 1-26-6.10): No department, agency, institution, board, commission, or other entity of state government may restrict or prohibit by any rule, policy, standard, or other directive any person's right or privilege to carry or possess a pistol concealed. Any resident of this state may bring a declaratory judgment action in accordance with chapter 21-24 in any circuit court to enforce this section."
